  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "國際保險會計",
    "sub_ename": "INTERNATIONAL INSURANCE ACCOUNTING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹國際財務報導準則第17號。1.如何運用一般衡量模型與變動收費法來衡量合約服務邊際及損失組成部分並反映長期保險合約的利潤與損失。2.如何以新的市場資訊重新評價保險負債及其對當期和未來的損益造成的影響。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces IFRS 17 accounting standard for insurance contracts. The major contents are two approaches, general measurement model (GMM) and variable fee approach (VFA) for calculating profit or loss for long-term insurance contracts using the concept of contractual service margin (CSM) and loss component (LC). Also, how insurance liabilities are revalued using updated market information period and how this affects current and future profits and losses are explained.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "使學生理解最新國際保險合約會計與保險公司財務績效",
      "describe_en": "Student can understand the knowledge and issues of IFRS 17 for insurance contracts accounting."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "使學生應用國際保險合約會計",
      "describe_en": "Student can apply the knowledge of IFRS 17 for insurance contracts accounting"
    }
  ],
